    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Null Maiden Vigil",
    "summary": "This detachment changes your army as follows:\n\n- As you muster your army, you may pick an **ANATHEMA PSYKANA CHARACTER** model of yours as your **WARLORD**.\n- Your **PROSECUTOR SQUAD** units gain the **BATTLELINE** keyword.\n- Every friendly **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit has the Creeping Dread (Aura) ability.\n\n**Creeping Dread (Aura)**: during the opponent's Command phase, at its Battle-shock step, every enemy **PSYKER** unit, and every enemy unit below its **starting strength**, within 12\" of that **ANATHEMA PSYKANA** unit must roll for battle-shock, taking -1 on that roll.",
